Planning & Logging of Work

For this assignment we mainly used Teams and WhatsApp for communication. We had
meetings on Teams to decide how to breakdown our project workflow and we also used
Microsoft Planner to keep a track of individual tasks each of us was working on throughout
the project. Each group member at first individually developed the project as much as
they could and then we came together as a group and shared our progress. After sharing
progress and discussing which elements we like, we compiled the final version of the game
and then proceeded to edit so that we can add any bonus features we see fit or fix any
errors which occurred.

